# index-fixed-range-line: Does a constant index next to a range read as the numbered name (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: r@1=5 yy@3=-3 rows=3
# pc: ok
# states: 2
# ruling: pc-ode reads `name[n]` as `name<n>` on a range line too, so `flux[3]` and `flux3` are the same fixed quantity (language.md, Arrays).
flux[1..3]=[j]*x
y'=-flux[3]
x'=0
x(0)=1
y(0)=0
aux r=flux[2]+flux3
aux yy=y
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
